---
import Section from './section.astro';
---

<Section title="What is Dotabout?">
  <p class="content">
    <strong>Dotabout</strong>
    is an open-source bio page that lives on your GitHub. Instead of creating
    yet another account, all you need is a public repo named
    <strong>.about</strong>
    with a simple <code>about.json</code> file inside. From there, your profile
    is generated automatically and stays fully in your control. (Example:
    <a class="mono" href="https://dotabout.me/@remvze">dotabout.me/@remvze</a>)
  </p>
</Section>

<style>
.content {
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: var(--color-foreground-subtle);

  & strong {
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }

  & code {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 2px 8px;
    margin: 0 2px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--font-xsm);
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    background: var(--color-neutral-100);
    border-radius: 8px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 -1px 0 var(--color-neutral-300);
  }

  & a {
    color: var(--color-foreground);
    text-decoration: underline dotted #ff6b6b;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;

    &.mono {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: var(--font-sm);
    }
  }
}
</style>
